[subsection {Version 0.9.4.24}]
[para]
[list_begin itemized]
[item] [file src/main.tcl] ([cmd CanvasDoTkoPathItem]): Fixed crash when
[cmd {$path coords $id}] returns an empty list. This happened for
[const window] items, [const group] items, and items with [option -matrix]
set. Added length guard: if coords has fewer than 2 elements, the item
