with signature fields.
[item] New options [option -required] and [option -label] in
[method addForm].
[list_end]

[subsection {Version 0.9.4.16}]
[list_begin itemized]
[item] AES-256 encryption (V=5, R=6, PDF 2.0, ISO 32000-2 §7.6.4).
New option [option -encversion]: [const 4] (AES-128, default) or
[const 5] (AES-256). SHA-384/512 via openssl subprocess (superseded
