[item] PDF/A-1b and PDF/A-2b support via [option -pdfa] option.
[item] XMP metadata stream with pdfaid identification schema
([term pdfaid:part], [term pdfaid:conformance]).
[item] OutputIntent with sRGB ICC profile ([option -pdfa-icc] for explicit path).
[item] [term /Group/S/Transparency] suppressed for PDF/A-1 pages.
[item] Binary comment (4 bytes > 0x7F) in PDF header.
[item] Fixed [term /Length] calculation to use UTF-8 byte count.
[list_end]

[subsection {Version 0.9.4.7}]
